<title>JAPAN: Hamai Industries -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hamai Industries -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
